{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1328291-ok-that-s-it-fuck-the-format","id":1328291,"title":"OK that's it. Fuck the format.","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-07-30T08:06:03-07:00","id":1328291,"title":"OK that's it. Fuck the format.","content":"I just spent an hour typing out an entire essay on how you can use terrestrial sorcery in space. And I lost it. Why? Cause the webpage posted it way too slowly, and I turned off the computer before it finished. Now the data's lost, and i'm going to have to take another hour. <br /> <br /> Why the hell is it so slow, and why does my computer keep on shouting that this site is 'not secure'?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-30T09:27:55-07:00","id":1328312,"title":"","content":"Works fine for me.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-30T09:31:08-07:00","id":1328314,"title":"","content":"I always get 'stuck' when i press Post, it always work to simply press F5 and refresh the page and boom, it works. <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2610-lycaniz","name":"lycaniz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2610_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"56"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-30T09:39:45-07:00","id":1328315,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Accelerator</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1328291-ok-that-s-it-fuck-the-format#post1328291\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I just spent an hour typing out an entire essay on how you can use terrestrial sorcery in space. And I lost it. Why? Cause the webpage posted it way too slowly, and I turned off the computer before it finished. Now the data's lost, and i'm going to have to take another hour.<br /> <br /> Why the hell is it so slow, and why does my computer keep on shouting that this site is 'not secure'?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <span style=\"font-size:12px\">I notice the occasional slowness, especially when posting, but not to degree you described.<br /> <br /> Your browser complaining about the site being 'not secure' is because the site is not using HTTPS. <span style=\"color:#333333\"><span style=\"font-family:Roboto\">HTTPS uses the SSL/TLS protocol to provide a secure connection, which is both encrypted and authenticated. </span></span> If I remember correctly, they tried switching it to https and ran into a lot of problems which effectively broke the site and they didn't have access to the resources that would have been needed to pursue a solution so they switched it back to non-https. If you are concerned, I would primarily make sure that you don't use your password for this site anywhere else (which is sound advice regardless). </span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1039-brennanhawkwood","name":"Brennanhawkwood","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"56"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-30T10:14:49-07:00","id":1328324,"title":"","content":"Did you have lost of links in your post? One of the anti-spam features triggers pretty easily if there are a ton of links to make sure bots don\u2019t overwhelm the site. It doesn\u2019t trigger if you edit the links in afterwards.<br /> <br /> Either way, if you are making a lengthy post, I\u2019d advise writing it in Google Docs first so you don\u2019t lose it if something glitches.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://tinyurl.com/2p8ss75f\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Chris H</b></a>/<b>EndDaysEngine</b> | <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/EndDaysEngine\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Patreon</b></a></span>| <b>He/His </b>| <b>Currently Writing</b>: <i>[Redacted], [Redacted]</i><br /> <br /> <b>CofD booklists: </b><a href=\"https://goo.gl/DRdB7h\" target=\"_blank\">Beast</a> I <a href=\"https://goo.gl/x1FPpM\" target=\"_blank\">Changeling</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/ZSCx5U\" target=\"_blank\">Demon</a> | <a href=\"http://shorturl.at/syDK9\" target=\"_blank\">Deviant</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/Mh5M6m\" target=\"_blank\">Geist</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/gSjfm5\" target=\"_blank\">Hunter</a> l <a href=\"https://goo.gl/qj5aX9\" target=\"_blank\">Mage</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/2HCpjg\" target=\"_blank\">Mummy</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/68yRHY\" target=\"_blank\">Promethean</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/a4mjqA\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> | <a href=\"https://goo.gl/hrULtN\" target=\"_blank\">Werewolf</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4433-second-chances","name":"Second Chances","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4433_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4202"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-07-30T10:48:48-07:00","id":1328327,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Second Chances</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1328291-ok-that-s-it-fuck-the-format?p=1328324#post1328324\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Did you have lost of links in your post? One of the anti-spam features triggers pretty easily if there are a ton of links to make sure bots don\u2019t overwhelm the site. It doesn\u2019t trigger if you edit the links in afterwards.<br /> <br /> Either way, if you are making a lengthy post, I\u2019d advise writing it in Google Docs first so you don\u2019t lose it if something glitches.</div> </div> </div> </div>How many is lots?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12952-accelerator","name":"Accelerator","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3232"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date